# Keep the build context small and, more importantly, keep local material out
# of the image. A stray .env or a local venv in a layer is a credential leak
# and an architecture mismatch respectively.
.venv/
venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
tests/
NOTES.md
README.md
.env
*.env
*.json.key
*.pem
.git/
.gitignore
